    "title": "Two South Florida counties warned of 50 mph thunderstorm winds knocking down trees - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lauren Morris ,\n14 hours ago The National Weather Service issued a weather alert to two counties in Florida warning of debris from strong storm winds. A weather alert was issued by the National Weather Service for strong thunderstorms with up to 50 mph winds until 3 p.m. for Metro Palm Beach County and Coastal Palm Beach County in Florida. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 32",
